Case Study 53: Food Waste Monitoring System
1. Problem Statement
Calculate leftover meals and food-wastage percentage across several days.
2. Objectives
•	Store daily meal data in lists.
•	Calculate leftover meals.
•	Identify days with high wastage.
3. Algorithm
23.	Store meals prepared and meals served in lists.
24.	For each day, calculate leftovers and wastage percentage.
25.	Compare wastage with the 10% limit.
26.	Display the daily results.
4. Python Source Code
days = ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday"]
prepared = [100, 120, 80]
served = [90, 100, 76]

for i in range(len(days)):
    leftover = prepared[i] - served[i]
    waste = leftover / prepared[i] * 100
    print(days[i], "leftover:", leftover)
    print("Wastage:", round(waste, 2), "%")

    if waste > 10:
        print("Above acceptable limit")
    else:
        print("Within limit")
